# Browser hardening for every page. Cloudflare Pages reads this file from
# the build output and adds the headers at the edge.
#
# The policy is strict where it matters. Scripts: the built HTML carries no
# inline script and no on* handlers - every script is an external /_astro/
# file - so script-src is 'self' plus the analytics host, and an injected
# script could never run. Styles: 'unsafe-inline' is allowed on purpose,
# the one exception, because Shiki colours code samples with a style
# attribute on every token (CodeExample.astro); a static site with no
# user content rendered into its pages gives CSS injection nothing to
# work with, and the highlighting is worth more than the last letter of
# a header grade. Card images and the JSON the Download button fetches
# come from api.kairosarchive.net; the Fun Zone's tools ask the query API
# on query.kairosarchive.net from the browser. Outbound-click beacons go
# to stats.kairosarchive.net (Base.astro, sendBeacon). When the Web
# Analytics token is set at build time, Base.astro loads Cloudflare's
# beacon script from static.cloudflareinsights.com and that script reports
# to cloudflareinsights.com; both are listed here whether or not the token
# is set, since this file is static, and neither can be reached by anything
# but that script. Nothing else leaves the origin. frame-ancestors 'none'
# and X-Frame-Options together stop the site being framed by anyone, which
# is the one thing a card archive never needs.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' https://api.kairosarchive.net; connect-src 'self' https://api.kairosarchive.net https://query.kairosarchive.net https://stats.kairosarchive.net https://cloudflareinsights.com; font-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
